 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "六人から、受け取りを確認できていないと連絡がありました。一体どうしたんでしょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D001-S01",
    "C53-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 5.598,
   "duration_sec": 5.598
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "申し込んだ人は二十四人で、送信リストにも二十四人の名前があります。送ったはずなんですが。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D002-S01",
    "C53-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 5.948,
   "end_sec": 13.01,
   "duration_sec": 7.062
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "送信操作の記録もありますね。ただ、相手に届いたかどうかは、この記録では確認できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D003-S01",
    "C53-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 13.36,
   "end_sec": 20.165,
   "duration_sec": 6.805
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "六人から連絡があったものだから、送るのを忘れたと思ったんです。気が咎めます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D004-S01",
    "C53-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 20.515,
   "end_sec": 26.778,
   "duration_sec": 6.263
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "私も「届いていないわけがない」と考えました。でも、根拠が足りませんね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D005-S01",
    "C53-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 27.128,
   "end_sec": 32.231,
   "duration_sec": 5.103
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "ええ。送信操作がなかったという意味でも、全員が受け取ったという意味でもありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D006-S01",
    "C53-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 32.581,
   "end_sec": 38.442,
   "duration_sec": 5.861
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "道理で、この記録だけでは受け取りが分からないわけですね。六人は参加したんですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D007-S01",
    "C53-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 38.792,
   "end_sec": 44.399,
   "duration_sec": 5.607
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "まだ分かりません。メールと欠席の関係は不明です。メールのせいだとは判断できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D008-S01",
    "C53-D008-S02",
    "C53-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 44.749,
   "end_sec": 51.162,
   "duration_sec": 6.413
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "では、記入の手違いや受信設定、遅延を確認しましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D009-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 51.512,
   "end_sec": 56.284,
   "duration_sec": 4.772
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "故障もまだ可能性です。原因が分からないのは、情報が足りないためです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D010-S01",
    "C53-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 56.634,
   "end_sec": 61.959,
   "duration_sec": 5.325
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "金曜日までに調べます。先に謝ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D011-S01",
    "C53-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 62.309,
   "end_sec": 67.034,
   "duration_sec": 4.725
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "不便について謝るんです。自分の間違いだと決めることとは別です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D012-S01",
    "C53-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 67.384,
   "end_sec": 72.184,
   "duration_sec": 4.8
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "納得しました。実は、前の職場でも説明の態度でもめたんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D013-S01",
    "C53-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 72.534,
   "end_sec": 77.932,
   "duration_sec": 5.398
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "言葉の内容も口調も大切ですね。理屈が正しくても、乱暴な言い方では伝わりにくいです。どんな行き違いでしたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D014-S01",
    "C53-D014-S02",
    "C53-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 78.282,
   "end_sec": 88.603,
   "duration_sec": 10.321
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "相談会の件とは別の話ですね。返信の参考にしたいので、聞かせてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D015-S01",
    "C53-D015-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 88.953,
   "end_sec": 94.843,
   "duration_sec": 5.89
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "はい。私はひそひそと相談していたら、「悪者にするのか」となじられました。本心では助けたかったんです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D016-S01",
    "C53-D016-S02",
    "C53-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 95.193,
   "end_sec": 104.292,
   "duration_sec": 9.099
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "助けたい気持ちと、責められたくない気持ちの葛藤があったんですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D017-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 104.642,
   "end_sec": 109.213,
   "duration_sec": 4.571
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "ええ。「俺たちを振り回すな」「お前は生意気だ」と怒る相手に、私も頭に来ました。「何を」と言い返して、口げんかになりました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D018-S01",
    "C53-D018-S02",
    "C53-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 109.563,
   "end_sec": 118.898,
   "duration_sec": 9.335
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "双方が乱暴な言葉を使うと、話が擦れ違いますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D019-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 119.248,
   "end_sec": 123.571,
   "duration_sec": 4.323
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "あの剣幕は怖かったです。私も「狡い」とぶつぶつ言いました。それなのに、自分だけ正しいと思っていました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D020-S01",
    "C53-D020-S02",
    "C53-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 123.921,
   "end_sec": 132.61,
   "duration_sec": 8.689
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "憎まれ口は恨みの元になりますね。でも、説明だけで喧嘩は収まったんですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D021-S01",
    "C53-D021-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 132.96,
   "end_sec": 139.274,
   "duration_sec": 6.314
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "いいえ。「だって、知らなかったんだもん」と弁解したら、「屁理屈だ」と言われました。後で謝りましたが、恥をかきました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D022-S01",
    "C53-D022-S02",
    "C53-D022-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 139.624,
   "end_sec": 148.266,
   "duration_sec": 8.642
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C53-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "「口は災いの門」ですね。とにかく、今回も相手の不安を聞きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C53-D023-S01",
    "C53-D023-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 148.616,
   "end_sec": 154.545,
   "duration_sec": 5.929
  }
 ],
