   "text": "自分の間違いだと決めることとは別です。",
   "start_sec": 69.514,
   "end_sec": 72.184,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "納得しました。",
   "start_sec": 72.534,
   "end_sec": 73.968,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "実は、前の職場でも説明の態度でもめたんです。",
   "start_sec": 74.118,
   "end_sec": 77.932,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "言葉の内容も口調も大切ですね。",
   "start_sec": 78.282,
   "end_sec": 81.887,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "理屈が正しくても、乱暴な言い方では伝わりにくいです。",
   "start_sec": 82.037,
   "end_sec": 86.626,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D014-S03",
   "unit_id": "C53-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "どんな行き違いでしたか。",
   "start_sec": 86.776,
   "end_sec": 88.603,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "相談会の件とは別の話ですね。",
   "start_sec": 88.953,
   "end_sec": 91.73,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "返信の参考にしたいので、聞かせてください。",
   "start_sec": 91.88,
   "end_sec": 94.843,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D016-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 95.193,
   "end_sec": 96.141,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D016-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "私はひそひそと相談していたら、「悪者にするのか」となじられました。",
   "start_sec": 96.291,
   "end_sec": 100.944,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D016-S03",
   "unit_id": "C53-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "本心では助けたかったんです。",
   "start_sec": 101.094,
   "end_sec": 104.292,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "助けたい気持ちと、責められたくない気持ちの葛藤があったんですね。",
   "start_sec": 104.642,
   "end_sec": 109.213,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "ええ。",
   "start_sec": 109.563,
   "end_sec": 110.115,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": {
    "text": "ええ。",
    "voice": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
    "audio_file": "repairs\\C53-D018-S01.wav",
    "origin": "bounded_same_voice_Lite_repair",
    "repair": "M05-ack",
    "repair_interval": [
     0,
     0.96
    ],
    "sha256": "f524d532afe492318ed33ae1884c0a9ef5b6a771243b687792e87d63bfbcd275"
   }
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "「俺たちを振り回すな」「お前は生意気だ」と怒る相手に、私も頭に来ました。",
   "start_sec": 110.266,
   "end_sec": 115.76,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C53-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "「何を」と言い返して、口げんかになりました。",
   "start_sec": 115.91,
   "end_sec": 118.898,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "双方が乱暴な言葉を使うと、話が擦れ違いますね。",
   "start_sec": 119.248,
   "end_sec": 123.571,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "あの剣幕は怖かったです。",
   "start_sec": 123.921,
   "end_sec": 126.152,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "私も「狡い」とぶつぶつ言いました。",
   "start_sec": 126.302,
   "end_sec": 128.786,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D020-S03",
   "unit_id": "C53-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "それなのに、自分だけ正しいと思っていました。",
   "start_sec": 128.936,
   "end_sec": 132.61,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "憎まれ口は恨みの元になりますね。",
   "start_sec": 132.96,
   "end_sec": 135.726,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "text": "でも、説明だけで喧嘩は収まったんですか。",
   "start_sec": 135.876,
   "end_sec": 139.274,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "いいえ。",
   "start_sec": 139.624,
   "end_sec": 140.584,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "「だって、知らなかったんだもん」と弁解したら、「屁理屈だ」と言われました。",
   "start_sec": 140.734,
   "end_sec": 145.469,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C53-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "text": "後で謝りましたが、恥をかきました。",
   "start_sec": 145.619,
   "end_sec": 148.266,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C53-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "「口は災いの門」ですね。",
   "start_sec": 148.616,
   "end_sec": 151.074,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C53-D023-S02",
   "unit_id": "C53-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "text": "とにかく、今回も相手の不安を聞きましょう。",
   "start_sec": 151.224,
   "end_sec": 154.545,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
